		// StateDanger: Waking · Use with care
		// StateArchive: Fragment · Cannot bind
		// EmptySlotName: No bound wraith
		// EmptySlotHint: Select a wraith to inspect it, then use the bind seal to place it in the single wraith slot. An empty slot enables no wraith ability
		// UsableSection: WRAITHS
		// CloseTagText: ROLL
		// CloseHintFormat: ESC · {0} · click outside to roll up
